error[E0277]: `Text<u32>` decodes everything till the end, so it can't be followed by anything
 --> tests/ui/final_in_the_middle.rs:6:21
  |
6 |     #[fiole(codec = Text<u32>)]
  |                     ^^^^ it can only be the last element of a tuple of codecs, or the last field of a struct deriving `Fiole`
  |
  = help: the trait `SelfDelimiting` is not implemented for `Text<u32>`
  = note: wrap it in `Fixed`, `Terminated` or `SizedCodec` for it to know where it ends
  = help: the following other types implement trait `SelfDelimiting`:
            &T
            (C1, C2)
            (C1, C2, C3)
            (C1, C2, C3, C4)
            (C1, C2, C3, C4, C5)
            (C1, C2, C3, C4, C5, C6)
            (C1, C2, C3, C4, C5, C6, C7)
            (C1, C2, C3, C4, C5, C6, C7, C8)
          and $N others
